Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.05,0:00:03.23,TL,,0,0,0,,两年前 他输给了辛纳 今天
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.23,0:00:04.85,TL,,0,0,0,,他回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.78,0:00:18.34,TL,,0,0,1240,,{\fs46}And it goes! What a shot to choose there from TFO.{\fs68}\N球一出界 蒂亚福选的这一拍就是全场唯一答案
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.34,0:00:25.02,TL,,0,0,1240,,{\fs46}The final is calling for Francis.{\fs68}\N决赛，在等着弗朗西斯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.07,0:00:26.32,TL,,0,0,0,,蒂亚福{\fs78}5{\fs68}岁那年
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.32,0:00:28.50,TL,,0,0,0,,第一次拿起球拍 是父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.50,0:00:31.47,TL,,0,0,0,,把这项运动带进了他的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.02,0:00:34.72,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}It{\fs68}'{\fs78}s{\fs68} {\fs78}just{\fs68} {\fs78}unbelievable{\fs68}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:35.94,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}I{\fs68} {\fs78}dreamt{\fs68} {\fs78}for{\fs68} {\fs78}this{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.94,0:00:37.24,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}but{\fs68} {\fs78}it{\fs68} {\fs78}came{\fs68} {\fs78}quicker{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.24,0:00:38.79,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}than{\fs68} {\fs78}I{\fs68} {\fs78}expected{\fs68}. {\fs78}Being{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.79,0:00:39.68,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}a{\fs68} {\fs78}little{\fs68} {\fs78}kid{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.68,0:00:41.14,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}he{\fs68} {\fs78}wanted{\fs68} {\fs78}this{\fs68} {\fs78}moment{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.14,0:00:41.63,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}so{\fs68} {\fs78}bad{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.63,0:00:42.61,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}and{\fs68} {\fs78}he{\fs68} {\fs78}would{\fs68} {\fs78}be{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.61,0:00:44.23,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}insanely{\fs68} {\fs78}happy{\fs68}. {\fs78}And{\fs68} {\fs78}now{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.23,0:00:45.37,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}he{\fs68}'{\fs78}s{\fs68} {\fs78}living{\fs68} {\fs78}it{\fs68}.\N
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.37,0:00:45.94,TL,,0,0,0,,简直难以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.94,0:00:46.59,TL,,0,0,0,,我梦想过这一天
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.59,0:00:47.56,TL,,0,0,0,,只是它来得比我以为的快
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.56,0:00:48.37,TL,,0,0,0,,他还是个孩子的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.37,0:00:49.11,TL,,0,0,0,,就那么渴望这一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.11,0:00:50.08,TL,,0,0,0,,如果做到了他会高兴疯掉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.08,0:00:51.22,TL,,0,0,0,,而现在 他真的活成了这样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.27,0:00:53.27,TL,,0,0,0,,两年前 同一座球场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.27,0:00:55.87,TL,,0,0,0,,他也曾站上这里的决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.57,0:00:58.92,TL,,0,0,0,,那一次 {\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.92,0:01:01.27,TL,,0,0,0,,他把冠军留给了辛纳
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.97,0:01:08.95,TL,,0,0,0,,两年后的{\fs78}6{\fs68}月 在哈雷
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.95,0:01:10.62,TL,,0,0,0,,他把这座奖杯举了起来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.62,0:01:12.68,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}10{\fs68}年没赢过的对手弗里茨
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.68,0:01:14.22,TL,,0,0,0,,这次终于被他拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.22,0:01:17.26,TL,,0,0,0,,生涯第一个{\fs78}ATP500{\fs68}冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.97,0:01:21.24,TL,,0,0,0,,半决赛 他一度{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}落后
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.24,0:01:24.19,TL,,0,0,0,,面临{\fs78}3{\fs68}个盘点 全部救下 {\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.19,0:01:27.73,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68} 重新杀回了辛辛那提决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.89,0:01:39.76,TL,,0,0,0,,而这一次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.76,0:01:42.19,TL,,0,0,0,,无论谁笑到最后都已经是历史
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.19,0:01:43.34,TL,,0,0,0,,大师赛历史上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.34,0:01:45.95,TL,,0,0,0,,第一次有两位黑人球员打进决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.95,0:01:48.00,TL,,0,0,0,,蒂亚福的父母来自塞拉利昂
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.00,0:01:50.31,TL,,0,0,0,,菲斯的父亲来自海地
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.89,0:01:55.18,TL,,0,0,0,,两年前 他从这里离开时
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.18,0:01:57.52,TL,,0,0,0,,手里没有奖杯 今晚
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.52,0:02:00.23,TL,,0,0,0,,他又一次站上这里的决赛 这一次
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.23,0:02:03.28,TL,,0,0,0,,蒂亚福能把奖杯留在辛辛那提吗？
